## 1. Feature Classification Matrix

Every feature from the reference project has been analyzed and categorized into **Core** (auto-included), **Optional** (modular/toggleable), or **Project-Specific** (excluded):

| Feature / Module | Classification | Description & Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| **Base Settings & Split Config Architecture** | **Core** | Modular `decouple`/`dotenv` settings separation into Base, Dev, and Prod environments with env validation. |
| **User Management (`eg_user`)** | **Core** | Custom `EgUser` (`AbstractUser`, `is_deleted`, `failed_login_attempts`, `is_locked`), `UserProfile`, custom auth backend, views, forms. |
| **Generic JWT Infrastructure** | **Core** | Generalized `JWTAuthentication` / `JWTGroupsMiddleware` (user & group population) decoupled from company/project domain checks. |
| **Generic API Views & Serializers** | **Core** | `CustomListCreateAPIView`, `CustomRetrieveUpdateDestroyAPIView`, `CommonListView`, `GeneralSerializer` (QueryDict mutable pre_init), `CustomMixinSerializer` (`show_<field>`). |
| **DRF Custom Exception Handler** | **Core** | Multi-source i18n language resolution (`Content-Language`, `Accept-Language`, `?lang=`), leaf error translation, and standardized JSON response envelope. |
| **Model Mixins & Utility Helpers** | **Core** | `CustomModelsBasicMixins` (`DirtyFieldsMixin`), `core/utils/common.py` (model converters, JSON encoders, security, string, and math helpers). |
| **Practice Directory Pattern** | **Core (Dev)** | Reusable `practice/` directory structure with starter `.ipynb` notebooks for ORM, API, Celery, and Auth testing. |
| **Translation Management (`translation_management`)** | **Optional** | Multilingual field translation, Google Translate integration, locale paths, dynamic registry, toggleable via `TRANSLATION_ENABLED`. |
| **Celery & Task Infrastructure** | **Optional** | Standardized `celery.py` with `app.autodiscover_tasks()`, task signal metrics, worker health checks, and per-module task routing, toggleable via `ENABLE_CELERY`. |
| **Background Jobs (`background_jobs`)** | **Optional** | Reusable `BackgroundJob` model (UUID, progress, JSON request/result/error, SSE streaming endpoint, retention cleaner), decoupled from project models. |
| **CAPTCHA Module (`core/captcha`)** | **Optional** | High-legibility PIL image CAPTCHA generation and Redis/cache verification, toggleable via `ENABLE_LOGIN_CAPTCHA`. |
| **Prometheus Monitoring (`monitoring`)** | **Optional** | `django-prometheus`, `PrometheusMetricsMiddleware`, and generic DRF/Celery/Redis metrics in `core/metrics.py`, toggleable via `ENABLE_PROMETHEUS`. |
| **Channels / WebSockets (ASGI)** | **Optional** | Daphne + `channels` ASGI routing structure (`ProtocolTypeRouter`), toggleable via `ENABLE_CHANNELS`. |
| **Redis Caching & Session Store** | **Optional** | `django-redis` backend configuration with fallback to `LocMemCache`, toggleable via `USE_REDIS`. |
| **AWS S3 File Storage** | **Optional** | `django-storages` + `boto3` + CloudFront setup with fallback to local media, toggleable via `USE_AWS`. |
| **Domain-Specific Business Logic** | **Project-Specific** | Timelapse video generation, camera stream ingest, satellite imagery, 360 video, drone uploads, weighing scale logic -> **Excluded**. |

